    "status": "working-edition",
    "notes": "The fixed response after the Epistle. DEO is dative and GRÁTIAS accusative plural in the elliptical expression grátias ágere: the verb is understood. The 1962 Ritus servandus assigns the response to the minister at low Mass. De musica sacra n. 31 a names it among the people's first-degree responses at low Mass, and n. 25 a does the same at sung Mass.",
